{"id":2111,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2025年11月16日下午4时，电气与控制工程学院在01102H等四个教室顺利举行2026年大学生创新训练计划项目预立项答辩会。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BMR6GfnNLsLmlbMfz-aLNUDUl-8UzUkinzQkM4viMlW2Mz-0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyPLkyPn1ybnlUaUzvPU4VRozT2nNL4nRl4LmA2oRGZn7MFM8Qkoz74o7WFL4rkMmNJv2bjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm7YL4lJqdRnx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=21235&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E101F9ED0A71C1C99FFC3D5328F808DC/7FB9138B/35B69\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BU47GDMlMfozNsMf4GPM49YU4-anzVkknR6VoR-iUm-8L8l0gihFp2hmCIa0oSysMYhVMShRUmL4nR6fMllbM4fVUzQ7nRUbo7r2nmUanlWFnm-YnNMkLRQFoRG8Mz-Jv2bjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm7YL4lJqdRnx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=21235&e=.png\"></p><p>本次预立项共收到申报项目71项，其中教师出题47项，学生自拟24项，申报总数较去年增长24%。项目涵盖电气工程、自动化、智能控制、轨道交通、机器人、新能源、物联网与人工智能等多个前沿方向，紧密对接学科发展与国家战略需求，兼具学术价值与应用潜力。学院高度重视本次答辩，专门组织由院领导、系主任及骨干教师组成的专家组进行评审。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BU8UGsnzrRUmTfMflQRol7Do7QRUzWkVU4Q2n7-8L8CiUm70gihFp2hmCIa0MYhkn1yZnkyiUmMVozlbMzffMlQ7nzARU4G4MlC4M4WRLRVFLRQfLzvYLNWFMRN4nm9Jqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm7YL4lJqdRnx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=21235&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7BF8D5B3E95950A5FDE8CC035F372C01/06A1722B/493F8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 482px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Bo7VGfoRV2Uz67Lf4fVMll4n7QRozLk8nR-ZL4GaLz-ZUNC0gihFp2hmCIa0UYysLkyDMYyZUzMVLzv8M7W7LmL4MR-4nR7ZLzT2Um-DL8VFLRNsUzGDM7rFL47PMm78gtXaQ4Oeo4x/vDw0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4-PLmLigtA8pURcc&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=21235&e=.jpg\"></p><p>答辩过程中，各项目团队准备充分、表述清晰，围绕立项背景、研究目标、技术路线、实施方案与创新特色等内容进行了系统展示。评审专家就关键技术、实验设计、难点预判及预算合理性等方面展开提问，并提出建设性意见，对部分项目中存在的方向聚焦不足、技术路径不明等问题给予了具体指导，助力项目优化完善。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BL8VGVLzUDLzlPUfmAfMmCDM4VRnNrk7UzLDMz78MlLZU4L0gihFp2hmCIa0nkybU1hVU1hVUmGZLN-sLzNbn77DMRLYM4Qfn7CbU8VkLlWFoRliUNC4nRAFL494MR9Jv2bjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm7YL4lJqdRnx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=21235&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D9BEBEB082B7199DA643276ADF9CAB1B/855BF3D8/38348\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Bnm6G2UNM2nmMVLf8lZLNWfMR9PLNlkYUmQ7M4viLRCaoRG0gihFp2hmCIa0nky4oSybUSy8Lz-bn7U8nl-PnlLPnNMRMmWRL8LsnzvbL7nFo7UiU4vaMRAFoRv8Lm7Jv2bjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm7YL4lJqdRnx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=21235&e=.png\"></p><p>在热烈深入的交流中，本次预立项答辩圆满结束。这不仅是阶段性评审的完成，更是各项目迈向扎实研究的新开端。期待这些创新种子在未来的培育中生根发芽，结出丰硕成果！</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://ece.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=BMR6GfnNLsLmlbMfz-aLNUDUl-8UzUkinzQkM4viMlW2Mz-0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyPLkyPn1ybnlUaUzvPU4VRozT2nNL4nRl4LmA2oRGZn7MFM8Qkoz74o7WFL4rkMmNJv2bjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm7YL4lJqdRnx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=21235&e=.png"}